abstract: >-
  An anonymized developer-level industrial software engineering dataset
  containing aggregate Cycle Time and average Story Point delivery metrics,
  developer seniority, and a study-specific active Generative AI usage
  classification. The dataset accompanies the paper "The Effect of Generative
  Artificial Intelligence on Developer Productivity in the Software Industry".
keywords:
  - "Generative Artificial Intelligence"
  - "software engineering"
  - "developer productivity"
  - "cycle time"
  - "story points"
  - "empirical software engineering"
  - "AI-assisted software development"

doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22279753"
